# Binary assets: never convert line endings or diff them as text.
# The resume PDF in particular has no NUL bytes, so Git would otherwise treat it as text and
# could rewrite its line endings on Windows checkouts, corrupting the approved file.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
